  "bio": "Christina Maslar is a highly skilled tattoo artist who specializes in black and gray, realism, and sketch styles. Located at Renaissance Studios in Endicott, New York, Christina is renowned for her attention to detail and the stunning lifelike quality of her tattoo work. Her dedication to the craft and the visual elegance of her art pieces can also be found through her collaborations with Dark Art Emporium and Thumbprint Gallery.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Endicott, New York, United States"
